1
00:00:16,266 --> 00:00:20,520
RANMA1/2

2
00:01:42,977 --> 00:01:44,187
I don't care.

3
00:01:44,938 --> 00:01:48,858
From now on, I don't wanna have
anything to do with you anymore!

4
00:02:02,372 --> 00:02:03,957
Akane?

5
00:02:14,425 --> 00:02:15,802
I think she's broken.

6
00:02:15,885 --> 00:02:17,095
Yeah, she's in shock.

7
00:02:17,178 --> 00:02:18,429
You're cruel.

8
00:02:18,513 --> 00:02:19,514
Just the worst.

9
00:02:20,223 --> 00:02:22,267
Who even are you?

10
00:02:22,851 --> 00:02:24,644
I was thinking the same thing.

11
00:02:24,727 --> 00:02:26,396
I thought Saotome was fighting.

12
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:27,897
Yeah. Where did he go?

13
00:02:27,981 --> 00:02:30,400
Now isn't the time
to nitpick all the little details.

14
00:02:31,401 --> 00:02:33,153
I'm more worried about Akane.

15
00:02:33,236 --> 00:02:35,697
It's a relief to see
you are free from harm.

16
00:02:35,780 --> 00:02:38,700
Yeah. No damage at all
if we ignore that chunk of hair.

17
00:02:43,163 --> 00:02:45,123
All right, Akane. You can hit me.

18
00:02:45,790 --> 00:02:47,041
Yes. Me too.

19
00:02:48,543 --> 00:02:51,212
- Huh?
- You don't have to hold back.

20
00:02:51,296 --> 00:02:52,922
Do whatever you need to feel better.

21
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:04,601
She doesn't hide how she feels.

22
00:03:04,684 --> 00:03:05,727
Yeah.

23
00:03:06,227 --> 00:03:11,191
WHO SAYS YOU'RE CUTE

24
00:03:24,954 --> 00:03:26,122
That hurts.

25
00:03:27,123 --> 00:03:29,584
I must have twisted my ankle
when I tripped.

26
00:03:31,169 --> 00:03:34,005
I'm pretty close to the clinic.
I should go.

27
00:03:39,552 --> 00:03:41,429
Aw, she's really upset.

28
00:03:53,191 --> 00:03:56,110
That should do it, Akane.
Take care of yourself.

29
00:03:56,194 --> 00:03:58,363
'Kay, Dr. Tofu. I'll see you later.

30
00:03:58,446 --> 00:03:59,989
Oh, Akane.

31
00:04:01,115 --> 00:04:02,909
Oh! Hey there, big sis.

32
00:04:03,785 --> 00:04:04,786
OSTEOPATHIC CLINIC

33
00:04:04,869 --> 00:04:06,329
Were you in another fight today?

34
00:04:06,829 --> 00:04:10,083
Thank you for taking care of her,
Dr. Tofu. We appreciate it.

35
00:04:10,166 --> 00:04:12,168
Oh! I...

36
00:04:12,252 --> 00:04:14,337
Sure. Well, uh...

37
00:04:14,963 --> 00:04:16,673
You know...

38
00:04:16,756 --> 00:04:17,966
Doctor?

39
00:04:20,051 --> 00:04:22,679
Akane, you've become
quite the little tomboy.

40
00:04:28,601 --> 00:04:31,020
Maybe I should grow my hair long.

41
00:04:31,729 --> 00:04:34,482
Then I could be more like Kasumi.

42
00:04:39,612 --> 00:04:40,863
Huh?

43
00:04:44,951 --> 00:04:47,078
Uh, hello.

44
00:04:47,829 --> 00:04:50,081
You expected me to be crying about this?

45
00:04:50,665 --> 00:04:51,874
Yeah, kinda.

46
00:04:53,167 --> 00:04:55,378
Well, I'm not upset. Leave me alone.

47
00:05:01,384 --> 00:05:03,428
Ah. It's tasty.

48
00:05:05,555 --> 00:05:08,349
Oh, Akane. Did you just get ba--

49
00:05:12,854 --> 00:05:15,898
That's a bit of an overreaction
to a haircut, don't you think?

50
00:05:15,982 --> 00:05:17,442
But what on earth happened to you?

51
00:05:17,525 --> 00:05:20,445
- It was my fault.
- I just figured it was time for a change.

52
00:05:21,154 --> 00:05:23,156
Could you help? I wanna clean it up.

53
00:05:30,955 --> 00:05:32,165
Hmm.

54
00:05:33,791 --> 00:05:36,586
If my worrying about you is
gonna be that annoying,

55
00:05:36,669 --> 00:05:37,795
fine then.

56
00:05:40,757 --> 00:05:43,176
Okay, I gotta go apologize.

57
00:05:48,473 --> 00:05:50,099
Akane!

58
00:05:52,602 --> 00:05:55,730
Oh. So sorry to bother you. Wrong person.

59
00:05:55,813 --> 00:05:57,482
Who are you looking for?

60
00:05:57,565 --> 00:05:58,733
Hmm?

61
00:05:59,734 --> 00:06:01,486
What's wrong? You've got a face.

62
00:06:02,487 --> 00:06:03,488
It is you?

63
00:06:04,072 --> 00:06:05,573
Nice change of pace, right?

64
00:06:05,656 --> 00:06:08,117
Um, I, uh...

65
00:06:08,201 --> 00:06:09,202
Sorry.

66
00:06:09,911 --> 00:06:13,039
Really? Not like you to apologize.

67
00:06:13,539 --> 00:06:14,916
- Hey now.
- It's all right.

68
00:06:14,999 --> 00:06:15,875
Huh?

69
00:06:15,958 --> 00:06:19,587
It's not a big deal. I was wanting
to get a haircut soon anyway.

70
00:06:26,094 --> 00:06:28,930
You okay? You want a piggyback ride?

71
00:06:29,013 --> 00:06:31,474
Stop being nice to me. It's weird.

72
00:06:33,601 --> 00:06:34,977
Oh, Akane.

73
00:06:35,061 --> 00:06:36,979
Good to see you today, Dr. Tofu.

74
00:06:37,063 --> 00:06:40,733
- Wow. You cut your hair short again.
- Yep.

75
00:06:40,817 --> 00:06:42,568
Hmm? Again?

76
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:44,821
Hmm...

77
00:06:45,530 --> 00:06:47,907
Just looks like a light ankle sprain.

78
00:06:48,491 --> 00:06:50,535
- Doctor.
- Huh?

79
00:06:50,618 --> 00:06:53,454
Do you like it?

80
00:06:55,790 --> 00:06:58,209
Yeah, I think you look very cute.

81
00:06:59,001 --> 00:07:02,213
In fact, I always thought shorter hair
suited you much better.

82
00:07:04,215 --> 00:07:05,299
I figured.

83
00:07:15,726 --> 00:07:17,895
Oh, no.

84
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:19,981
- Stop crying.
- Did I hurt you?

85
00:07:20,606 --> 00:07:22,233
I'm sorry.

86
00:07:22,316 --> 00:07:24,235
No, I'm sorry.

87
00:07:24,318 --> 00:07:27,655
It's not that. I just need to calm down.

88
00:07:27,738 --> 00:07:30,324
Uh--

89
00:07:38,458 --> 00:07:39,459
What's on your mind?

90
00:08:03,316 --> 00:08:04,692
Can you just be normal?

91
00:08:10,990 --> 00:08:11,991
Hmm?

92
00:08:12,074 --> 00:08:15,119
Well, I feel much better
after letting that out.

93
00:08:15,203 --> 00:08:16,204
Hmm?

94
00:08:17,455 --> 00:08:18,664
Is something wrong?

95
00:08:18,748 --> 00:08:20,708
Ranma?

96
00:08:21,626 --> 00:08:22,668
Huh?

97
00:08:24,670 --> 00:08:25,880
Hmm?

98
00:08:25,963 --> 00:08:28,883
In the clinic, I heard him call you cute.

99
00:08:29,592 --> 00:08:30,843
I'm happy for you.

100
00:08:34,555 --> 00:08:36,265
Uh...

101
00:08:36,849 --> 00:08:39,727
It doesn't really matter. Yet.

102
00:08:39,810 --> 00:08:42,146
Okay, but it might matter
to me a little bit.

103
00:08:42,230 --> 00:08:45,483
Don't worry about the doctor. He's
always had a crush on my older sister.

104
00:08:45,566 --> 00:08:47,693
I'm over it now.

105
00:08:48,528 --> 00:08:50,863
I needed to sort my feelings out first.

106
00:08:55,493 --> 00:08:56,911
Oh. Huh?

107
00:08:56,994 --> 00:08:59,580
I forgot to say earlier, but...

108
00:09:00,957 --> 00:09:02,375
Huh?

109
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:06,712
That hairstyle looks good on you.

110
00:09:08,548 --> 00:09:11,092
Why are you giving me that look?

111
00:09:11,175 --> 00:09:12,552
Are you feeling okay?

112
00:09:12,635 --> 00:09:14,428
You don't have to make it weird!

113
00:09:14,512 --> 00:09:17,723
I'm okay, really.
Don't worry about cheering me up.

114
00:09:17,807 --> 00:09:19,642
That wasn't what I was doing!

115
00:09:19,725 --> 00:09:22,061
You aren't cute enough
for that compliment in the first place!

116
00:09:22,144 --> 00:09:24,272
Yeah? I never claimed to be cute anyway.

117
00:09:24,355 --> 00:09:25,856
Just listen!

118
00:09:25,940 --> 00:09:28,234
What I'm trying to say is I love you w--

119
00:09:31,696 --> 00:09:34,282
No. I mean...

120
00:09:35,157 --> 00:09:39,161
I guess you don't care what I like.
So I'll just be quiet.

121
00:09:39,245 --> 00:09:40,580
- Ranma.
- Huh?

122
00:09:44,250 --> 00:09:46,043
I'm glad to hear it.

123
00:09:46,127 --> 00:09:47,545
So thanks.

124
00:09:50,756 --> 00:09:53,551
I mean it. I'm happy.

125
00:09:54,385 --> 00:09:57,972
Whoa. Hang on.
Could she actually be...

126
00:09:59,599 --> 00:10:00,808
...kinda cute?

127
00:10:04,061 --> 00:10:05,187
You're open.

128
00:10:06,647 --> 00:10:07,648
Huh?

129
00:10:16,073 --> 00:10:17,116
What the hell was that?

130
00:10:17,199 --> 00:10:19,744
I got you good.

131
00:10:19,827 --> 00:10:21,954
Does that make you feel
a little less guilty now?

132
00:10:22,038 --> 00:10:25,499
- I knew you weren't cute!
- I don't care.

133
00:10:28,794 --> 00:10:31,422
Just you wait, Ranma.

134
00:10:31,505 --> 00:10:33,215
Our duel was left unsettled.

135
00:10:33,841 --> 00:10:35,718
But I'll storm the Tendo Dojo,

136
00:10:35,801 --> 00:10:38,971
and finally put an end to
this violent battle between us.

137
00:10:50,608 --> 00:10:52,276
ANYTHING GOES
MARTIAL ARTS TENDO DOJO

138
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:54,737
The Tendo Dojo. This must be it.

139
00:11:04,372 --> 00:11:06,082
Wake up, Ranma.

140
00:11:06,624 --> 00:11:08,459
Fight me.

141
00:11:09,377 --> 00:11:12,046
Ranma.

142
00:11:12,129 --> 00:11:14,215
Wake up now!

143
00:11:14,298 --> 00:11:15,800
Mmm.

144
00:11:17,593 --> 00:11:19,387
Enough, Ranma!

145
00:11:24,475 --> 00:11:27,645
- Open your damn eyes!
- Huh?

146
00:11:28,145 --> 00:11:30,147
QUIET!

147
00:11:37,113 --> 00:11:39,782
What the hell, man?
What do you want this late at night?

148
00:11:39,865 --> 00:11:40,991
That's enough out of you.

149
00:11:41,075 --> 00:11:42,993
Revenge comes at any hour
of the day or night!

150
00:11:43,077 --> 00:11:45,246
This is so ridiculous.

151
00:11:45,329 --> 00:11:47,289
I still don't know what I did
to set off this grudge.

152
00:11:47,373 --> 00:11:50,918
Before I deliver you to hell,
I'll share one more thing.

153
00:11:51,711 --> 00:11:55,005
Once I came to the realization that you
ran away from our duel,

154
00:11:55,089 --> 00:11:58,008
I chased you all the way to China!

155
00:12:02,638 --> 00:12:03,639
Really?

156
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:05,975
So then, you went to Jusenkyo?

157
00:12:08,310 --> 00:12:09,979
So you transform in cold water too?

158
00:12:10,062 --> 00:12:11,439
Enough!

159
00:12:11,522 --> 00:12:14,150
The two of us have nothing more
to discuss.

160
00:12:18,028 --> 00:12:20,114
It's so noisy outside.

161
00:12:21,282 --> 00:12:22,283
Hmm?

162
00:12:22,867 --> 00:12:24,243
- Akane.
- Huh?

163
00:12:24,869 --> 00:12:25,870
Are you up?

164
00:12:25,953 --> 00:12:27,413
Is that you, Kasumi?

165
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:30,416
You don't think it's a burglar, do you?

166
00:12:30,499 --> 00:12:31,584
I hope not.

167
00:12:33,878 --> 00:12:35,004
Hmm?

168
00:12:38,466 --> 00:12:40,134
I told you it was a burglar.

169
00:12:40,217 --> 00:12:42,178
He's got a sack of things he's stolen.

170
00:12:42,261 --> 00:12:43,637
I'm gonna go beat him up.

171
00:12:43,721 --> 00:12:46,557
- No, don't. You'll get hurt.
- Yeah, but...

172
00:12:49,101 --> 00:12:50,895
Use this.

173
00:13:00,905 --> 00:13:02,239
Huh?

174
00:13:05,451 --> 00:13:07,495
Ryoga.

175
00:13:07,578 --> 00:13:08,788
Ryoga?

176
00:13:09,371 --> 00:13:10,456
That's a relief.

177
00:13:10,539 --> 00:13:13,209
So it was just a friend of Ranma's, then.

178
00:13:18,631 --> 00:13:19,632
Hmm?

179
00:13:23,803 --> 00:13:25,721
Yeah, it's just like I thought.

180
00:13:25,805 --> 00:13:27,807
ILLEGAL DUMPING PROHIBITED
RESPECT THE NEIGHBORHOOD

181
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:35,648
Ryoga?

182
00:13:36,232 --> 00:13:39,819
I can't believe they were making
all that noise in the middle of the night.

183
00:13:41,695 --> 00:13:42,905
Someone's in here.

184
00:13:43,489 --> 00:13:45,866
Who's there? Show yourself now.

185
00:14:00,422 --> 00:14:02,466
Where'd you come from, little guy?

186
00:14:03,259 --> 00:14:04,468
You're okay.

187
00:14:05,594 --> 00:14:07,930
Come here, you don't have to be scared.

188
00:14:08,013 --> 00:14:09,890
Whoa, you're so wet.

189
00:14:09,974 --> 00:14:12,476
I guess you must have gotten lost
out in the rain?

190
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:13,644
Aw.

191
00:14:13,727 --> 00:14:15,354
You got a lump here.

192
00:14:17,898 --> 00:14:21,527
I gotta tell you, Ryoga.
I understand how you feel.

193
00:14:21,610 --> 00:14:24,113
But can you stop attacking me
at these weird hours.

194
00:14:24,196 --> 00:14:26,699
I already feel out of place because
this isn't my house.

195
00:14:28,075 --> 00:14:30,411
Ranma, why did you bring that dog inside?

196
00:14:30,494 --> 00:14:33,163
I dunno. I could ask you the same thing.

197
00:14:33,247 --> 00:14:35,374
Why'd you bring in this random pig?

198
00:14:36,375 --> 00:14:38,043
What's got you so upset?

199
00:14:38,127 --> 00:14:41,505
Be a good little piggy.
Let's get some medicine for your head.

200
00:14:44,675 --> 00:14:46,927
What's up with this guy?
Just look at him blush.

201
00:14:47,011 --> 00:14:48,554
Look at him what?

202
00:14:48,637 --> 00:14:50,180
He's a real perv, huh?

203
00:14:50,264 --> 00:14:52,099
Oh, it's a boy.

204
00:14:52,182 --> 00:14:53,434
Oh, yeah. You're right.

205
00:14:58,230 --> 00:15:00,774
So, uh, Ranma, what's with the dog?

206
00:15:01,442 --> 00:15:04,737
Trust me, Ryoga.
I'll take your secret to my grave.

207
00:15:04,820 --> 00:15:07,489
Oh, yeah.
I think that's Yamada's dog, Beth.

208
00:15:07,573 --> 00:15:08,574
Huh?

209
00:15:09,783 --> 00:15:10,910
Uh.

210
00:15:11,410 --> 00:15:14,038
Yeah, this is her. Hi, Beth.

211
00:15:20,502 --> 00:15:21,962
Just look away for a sec.

212
00:15:25,299 --> 00:15:27,301
- What the...
- What are you doing?

213
00:15:27,843 --> 00:15:29,970
I knew this was stupid.

214
00:15:30,054 --> 00:15:31,472
Where are you off to now?

215
00:15:31,555 --> 00:15:35,935
The bath. I ended up getting soaked
because Ryoga chased me in the rain.

216
00:15:36,018 --> 00:15:37,186
Huh?

217
00:15:38,437 --> 00:15:40,439
Take the piggy and warm him up too.

218
00:15:41,732 --> 00:15:43,317
Take a bath with a pig?

219
00:15:44,485 --> 00:15:46,278
Ugh, man.

220
00:15:47,446 --> 00:15:50,658
So, if that wasn't Ryoga,
then where exactly did he run off to?

221
00:15:52,368 --> 00:15:54,244
Hey, man. You're gonna have to stay still.

222
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:57,706
Okay, one bath coming right up!

223
00:16:01,627 --> 00:16:02,628
Hmm?

224
00:16:12,554 --> 00:16:16,684
Ryoga, so you're a little piggy?

225
00:16:16,767 --> 00:16:20,396
- I will never forgive you.
- Wait, wait, wait!

226
00:16:22,231 --> 00:16:24,650
Okay, so you really went to Jusenkyo.

227
00:16:24,733 --> 00:16:25,734
I did.

228
00:16:25,818 --> 00:16:30,906
While chasing you, I lost myself
within the boundless expanse of China.

229
00:16:30,990 --> 00:16:33,367
The days passed relentlessly.

230
00:16:33,909 --> 00:16:35,369
Damn it.

231
00:16:35,452 --> 00:16:36,954
That bastard Ranma.

232
00:16:37,037 --> 00:16:39,498
Can't believe
he had the nerve to stand me up.

233
00:16:39,999 --> 00:16:42,001
And on that fateful day...

234
00:16:42,084 --> 00:16:43,085
Huh?

235
00:16:45,295 --> 00:16:47,423
Get back here!

236
00:16:47,506 --> 00:16:48,465
Huh?

237
00:16:55,222 --> 00:16:59,601
There was a strange girl who knocked me
into the spring under the cliff.

238
00:17:00,102 --> 00:17:02,896
And then, my body changed...

239
00:17:08,694 --> 00:17:12,781
From that day on,
the horrors I lived were never ending.

240
00:17:13,574 --> 00:17:16,952
Well done, sir.
This piggy looks especially delicious.

241
00:17:17,036 --> 00:17:18,662
Very good job indeed.

242
00:17:18,746 --> 00:17:20,456
I'll go cook it up right away.

243
00:17:21,331 --> 00:17:24,209
I know of a pool called
Spring Drowned Black Piglet

244
00:17:24,293 --> 00:17:26,045
that exists in Jusenkyo.

245
00:17:26,128 --> 00:17:28,630
A tragic legend
of its origination was that,

246
00:17:28,714 --> 00:17:32,426
a little black piglet drowned
in it over 1,200 years ago.

247
00:17:32,509 --> 00:17:34,762
Ever since that day
the waters were cursed.

248
00:17:34,845 --> 00:17:38,599
Everyone unfortunate enough to fall into
it gets turned into a little black piggy.

249
00:17:39,141 --> 00:17:40,517
Wait a second.

250
00:17:40,601 --> 00:17:44,104
Maybe this tiny fella was a human who fell
into the Spring of Drowned Black Piglet.

251
00:17:45,272 --> 00:17:47,941
Just wanted to have a bit
of a laugh before dinner.

252
00:17:51,111 --> 00:17:53,781
- Hot! Ow, hot! Ow! Hot!
- Oh, so he was a human.

253
00:17:53,864 --> 00:17:55,908
We'll have to eat something else.

254
00:17:58,535 --> 00:18:00,954
My body turned into an abomination.

255
00:18:01,705 --> 00:18:03,582
And then I was almost devoured.

256
00:18:04,208 --> 00:18:06,835
None of this would have happened
if you showed up to fight!

257
00:18:06,919 --> 00:18:08,087
Hey, wait a second.

258
00:18:08,170 --> 00:18:09,088
I thought you were saying

259
00:18:09,171 --> 00:18:11,632
it was some random girl that made you
fall into the spring.

260
00:18:11,715 --> 00:18:13,008
So what if I did?

261
00:18:13,092 --> 00:18:15,719
Then it makes no freakin' sense
for you to hold a grudge against me.

262
00:18:15,803 --> 00:18:18,806
You should be blaming
that panda and the girl... Oh.

263
00:18:19,556 --> 00:18:20,557
Hmm?

264
00:18:25,145 --> 00:18:26,063
PARDON ME!

265
